msgstr "Použít změny"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/profile_offer.rs:381
msgid "Apply it in AI Graphics, with the game closed."
msgstr "Použijte ho v AI grafice se zavřenou hrou."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/measure_dialog.rs:221
msgid "Applying the optimizations"
msgstr "Používání optimalizací"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/graphics/diagnose.rs:82
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Architektura"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/profiles.rs:1019
msgid "Asked Steam to start %s. Its profile applies; the launch settings reach a Steam game only through Steam's launch options."
msgstr "Steam byl požádán o spuštění %s. Profil hry platí; nastavení spuštění se ke hře ze Steamu dostane jen přes možnosti spuštění Steamu."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:295 bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:365
