msgstr "Uspáno"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/optimization.rs:920
msgid "At launch Gamescope runs it at the game's own size, so the image is not scaled twice."
msgstr "Při spuštění ji Gamescope spustí ve vlastní velikosti hry, takže se obraz neškáluje dvakrát."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/error.rs:120
